### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Register a new user invalid data

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juanexample.com",
  "password": "a"
}

### Register a new user try role ADMIN
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@admin.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}